ss="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_1jid6_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="group/accordion-trigger relative flex flex-1 items-start justify-between rounded-md border border-transparent py-4 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-all outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50" itemProp="name" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="[&amp;&gt;*]:text-[16px]"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">Which forms of payment do you accept?</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:hidden" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto hidden size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:inline" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_5jid6_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_1jid6_" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down overflow-hidden text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div><div hidden="" itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Answer"><div itemProp="text"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">We accept <a target="_blank" href="https://oxylabs.io/products/buy-proxy-with-credit-card" class="has-[.pill-link-dark]:inline-block has-[.pill-link-dark]:no-underline has-[.pill-link-dark]:text-base has-[.pill-link-dark]:rounded-md has-[.pill-link-dark]:mt-sm has-[.pill-link-dark]:mr-sm has-[.pill-link-dark]:sm:mr-2xs has-[.pill-link-dark]:border-focus-inner has-[.pill-link-dark]:hover:bg-button-secondary has-[.pill-link-dark]:border-solid has-[.pill-link-dark]:border has-[.cta-link]:inline-block has-[.cta-link]:no-underline has-[.cta-link]:max-sm:block has-[.pill-link]:border-input-default has-[.pill-link]:hover:bg-muted has-[.pill-link]:border has-[.pill-link]:border-solid has-[.pill-link]:inline-block has-[.pill-link]:no-underline has-[.pill-link]:text-base has-[.pill-link]:rounded-md has-[.pill-link]:mt-sm has-[.pill-link]:mr-sm has-[.pill-link]:sm:mr-2xs text-proxies-600 visited:text-proxies-700 hover:text-proxies-600/80 last:mb-0">payment cards</a>, wire transfers (both in US Dollars and Euros), AliPay, PayPal. We do not accept Bitcoins.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="border-border border-b last:border-b-0" itemProp="mainEntity" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Question"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_2jid6_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="group/accordion-trigger relative flex flex-1 items-start justify-between rounded-md border border-transparent py-4 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-all outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50" itemProp="name" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="[&amp;&gt;*]:text-[16px]"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">Does the service fee include additional charges?</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:hidden" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto hidden size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:inline" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_6jid6_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_2jid6_" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down overflow-hidden text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div><div hidden="" itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Answer"><div itemProp="text"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">All payments for the Oxylabs services shall be free of any taxes, levies, duties, imports, fees, charges, and withholdings imposed by any authority. The client shall be responsible for payment of sales, value-added, or any other taxes of a similar nature which Oxylabs shall charge on top of fees for the services in all appropriate taxing jurisdictions where legally required.</p></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="border-border border-b last:border-b-0" itemProp="mainEntity" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Question"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-_R_3jid6_" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="group/accordion-trigger relative flex flex-1 items-start justify-between rounded-md border border-transparent py-4 text-left text-sm font-medium transition-all outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50" itemProp="name" data-radix-collection-item=""><div class="[&amp;&gt;*]:text-[16px]"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">What are Oxylabs pricing plans&#x27; limitations?</p></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:hidden" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none ml-auto hidden size-4 shrink-0 group-aria-expanded/accordion-trigger:inline" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-trigger-icon"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-_R_7jid6_" hidden="" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-_R_3jid6_" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="data-[state=closed]:animate-accordion-up data-[state=open]:animate-accordion-down overflow-hidden text-sm" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"></div><div hidden="" itemProp="acceptedAnswer" itemScope="" itemType="http://schema.org/Answer"><div itemProp="text"><p class="font-width-normal text-base text-accent-foreground">In case you reach the limit within your plan and would like to increase it, contact your account manager for more information. You can also top up via your dashboard.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="flex flex-col items-center p-4 md:p-6 bg-background [&amp;&amp;]:col-span-full dark"><div class="relative flex w-full max-w-screen-2xl justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] px-4 py-[72px] md:py-20"><div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden"><div class="aspect-[4/3] w-full" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="relative z-10 flex max-w-screen-sm flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4 light"><h2 class="m-0 font-bold font-width-expanded text-default text-heading2">Scale up your business with Oxylabs®</h2></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 md:flex-row"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="secondary" data-size="default" class="group/button focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 inline-flex shrink-0 select-none items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md border border-transparent bg-clip-padding text-sm font-medium outline-none transition-all focus-visible:ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;:active:not([aria-haspopup])]:translate-y-px [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrin